


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_b98c8225:


    "门的那边是一如往日的屋顶的光景，背靠在栏杆上的祥子正抽着烟。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_0332b334:



    voice "2SA_0649"
    sachiko "「回来啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_4c7de6f1:


    "看到圣夜子的身影，祥子轻轻地举起手打了个招呼。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_88a09896:



    voice "2MI_0755"
    miyako "「你要辞去管理人的职务么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_496b8667:



    voice "2SA_0650"
    sachiko "「啊咧，消息真灵通啊。伦她们说的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_79802d99:


    "圣夜子点了点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_f1f38200:



    voice "2SA_0651"
    sachiko "「姑且算是正在考虑的事情」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_0b1508d7:



    voice "2MI_0756"
    miyako "「辞职后怎么办呢？要去当画家么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_b54b9952:



    voice "2SA_0652"
    sachiko "「这个不错呢。不过还没有鲁莽到那个地步。可能又会去旅游吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_8a2bf608:



    voice "2MI_0757"
    miyako "「目的地呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_a8fd79ab:



    voice "2SA_0653"
    sachiko "「还没决定呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_a890497d:



    voice "2MI_0758"
    miyako "「或许这样自由也挺好的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_f946e0af:



    voice "2SA_0654"
    sachiko "「那个可爱的袋子里装的什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_2bd991b8:


    "祥子指了指圣夜子提着的袋子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_ae569fd1:



    voice "2MI_0759"
    miyako "「这个是情人节巧克力的装饰的材料，准备到时让文教我怎么做。可以稍微期待一下么」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_b60709cf:



    voice "2SA_0655"
    sachiko "「给我的么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_2d9aec2c:



    voice "2MI_0760"
    miyako "「嗯，是本命」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_bb09744f:



    voice "2SA_0656"
    sachiko "「啊哈哈，这种话不应该送的时候再说么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_d0e5e243:



    voice "2MI_0761"
    miyako "「啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_917c98f6:


    "两人开心地笑了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_842a6553:



    voice "2MI_0762"
    miyako "「还有就是……在织着一条围巾，虽然好像情人节前来不及了——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_7eb5167c:



    voice "2SA_0657"
    sachiko "「那个啊……我应该不会回来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_a8096155:


    "仿佛故意要将圣夜子的话打断。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_a24d03be:



    voice "2MI_0763"
    miyako "「……真的要走么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_1f2b2878:



    voice "2MI_0764"
    miyako "「那我跟你一起走」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_b8ec91c1:



    voice "2SA_0658"
    sachiko "「你还在上学吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_b674f221:



    voice "2MI_0765"
    miyako "「退学就行」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_b93a9065:



    voice "2SA_0659"
    sachiko "「不行哦，别这么轻易就——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_a9df2bdf:



    voice "2MI_0766"
    miyako "「你不也是这么轻易就辞去了管理人的职位么」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_5140af5f:



    voice "2SA_0660"
    sachiko "「那是因为，我是大人啊——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_b68d3414:



    voice "2MI_0767"
    miyako "「同样是从永恒中走过来的人，那几年没有什么差距。让我跟着——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_2f7179c2:



    voice "2SA_0661"
    sachiko "「说了不行！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_7a967166:


    "强势的拒绝让气氛为之一变。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_01ed3586:



    voice "2SA_0662"
    sachiko "「总之……我不能带着你」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_723bea61:


    "祥子想要躲闪的眼神被圣夜子的话又拉了回来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_f6e5816a:



    voice "2MI_0768"
    miyako "「我不能接受再也见不到你的事实」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_799d4e09:



    voice "2MI_0769"
    miyako "「因为是你邀请我，我才来到了这里，因为有你在，我才进了这所学校。如果没有你，我也没有理由再留在宿舍了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_26ca8c61:



    voice "2MI_0770"
    miyako "「我喜欢你」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_0150c0cc:


    "今天的风有点大。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_43d0d1c4:



    voice "2MI_0771"
    miyako "「或许确实如你所说，这只是印随行为。但是我相信稻妻的故事（※注解：古代日本人相信稻子是因为接纳了稻妻才结出了果实）」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_a6642655:


    "坚定不移的眼神。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_62aad1d2:


    "抵不过她的目光，祥子垂下了视线。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_8a0094cb:



    voice "2MI_0772"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_6dd28d3d:


    "圣夜子的视线坚定不移，静静地等待着祥子开口。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_58de2800:



    voice "2SA_0663"
    sachiko "「啊啊是啊…………我就是从这眼神中逃走的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_6ba50844:



    voice "2SA_0664"
    sachiko "「……谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_0fed4b6d:


    "祥子微笑着，用手轻轻抚摸圣夜子的头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_154d2756:



    voice "2MI_0773"
    miyako "「……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_6b12eadf:



    voice "2SA_0665"
    sachiko "「对不起。其实我一开始就知道的。你实在是太清纯了，心中所想全都一目了然」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_24811c30:



    voice "2SA_0666"
    sachiko "「我知道你的心意，却没能回应。你从未隐瞒过自己的心思，我却一直在隐瞒」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_c0e0ca7f:



    voice "2MI_0774"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_73f90080:


    "圣夜子摇摇头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_b07cf8a3:



    voice "2SA_0667"
    sachiko "「你真的很美，每次看到你的脸我都会胸口一紧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_d72ffe4f:


    "祥子梳理着圣夜子有些蓬乱的头发。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_24308a91:



    voice "2MI_0775"
    miyako "「因为这是我记忆中最美的面孔」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_885561fe:



    voice "2SA_0668"
    sachiko "「嗯，在我的记忆中也是呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_0487270a:


    "两人笑了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_9130d156:



    voice "2SA_0669"
    sachiko "「所以说……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_ec0ceeb9:


    "祥子轻轻地牵起圣夜子的手。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_23cef6aa:



    voice "2SA_0670"
    sachiko "「我不能回应你的心意」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_29818197:



    voice "2MI_0776"
    miyako "「……诶」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_839f643a:



    voice "2SA_0671"
    sachiko "「我一直都有喜欢的人」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_b5f74e6e:


    "书包从圣夜子手中滑落。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_9fe8607e:



    voice "2MI_0777"
    miyako "「啊……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_9a8e9c3a:


    "此刻圣夜子第一次产生了动摇。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_a9885765:



    voice "2MI_0778"
    miyako "「那个人也对你……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_88d1d3a1:



    voice "2SA_0672"
    sachiko "「很可惜，只是单相思」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_c56c1f6a:



    voice "2MI_0779"
    miyako "「唔，这个时候是不是说请加油比较好？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_c0decaba:



    voice "2SA_0673"
    sachiko "「谢谢。不过呢，肯定无法实现的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_2a437a4e:


    "说着，祥子从栏杆直起身子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_af9a0b20:



    voice "2MI_0780"
    miyako "「是把你邀请到地上的人么……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_22f7dd06:



    voice "2SA_0674"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_dac8011a:



    voice "2SA_0675"
    sachiko "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_17ddfccd:



    voice "2MI_0781"
    miyako "「那样的话，赢不了呢……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_3b4f15a1:


    "圣夜子被自己的话所束缚。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_fa936f21:



    voice "2SA_0676"
    sachiko "「抱歉——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_83fe1715:


    "祥子想去触碰圣夜子的脸，却在即将碰到的地方停了下来，无言地走过她身边。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_eeb68182:



    voice "2MI_0782"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_e415f967:



    voice "2SA_0677"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_40e8fe89:



    voice "2FU_0678"
    fumi "「额，那个……我们不是来偷听的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_e3bcca9d:


    "门后藏着阳菜她们。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_94430ede:



    voice "2SA_0678"
    sachiko "「没事。早就发现了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_71530fcc:



    voice "2HI_0812"
    hina "「啊哇哇……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_e55a2ad2:



    voice "2RI_0820"
    rin "「为什么——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_0288012e:



    voice "2SA_0679"
    sachiko "「她是一个好孩子，所以不是没有喜欢上她的可能性」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_123655e4:



    voice "2SA_0680"
    sachiko "「因此我才逃走的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_ff718e24:



    voice "2RI_0821"
    rin "「哈啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_4f0c78c9:



    voice "2SA_0681"
    sachiko "「抱歉，接下来就拜托你们了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_59cbe670:


    "拍拍伦的肩膀，祥子头也不回地走下了楼梯。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_0aba5366:



    voice "2RI_0822"
    rin "「那算什么啊！」"




translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_bd9e39ad:


    voice "2SA_0658"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_13_b0ba6520:


    sachiko "「你还在上学吧」"
